# PC card pc-melee-s1 (docs/plan-melee-top5.md, Stage 1, BENCH-109): one build alone on today's whole melee field, 46 fields x 6 seeds, at the machine's melee width (@C@, fixed at prep) and CPU constant. Template: s1prep writes work/melee-s1-<arm>.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @A@ = the arm's suffix (aa, bb, er, ep, ef); every arm fights the same fields and seeds, so the read pairs them battle for battle.
